==========================================================================
VERDICT
==========================================================================
  THE SAMPLE PREMISE IS FALSE, AND THE PROGRAMME RE-POINTS:
  (1) the Chae+21 environmental table has ZERO SPARC galaxies at eta >= 0.3 (max eta = 0.0388);
  (2) the SPARC curves never enter the EFE zone (median R_out/r_EFE = 0.256) -- a direction test there is underpowered by construction, matching h28's WALLABY null and its identifiability FAIL;
  (3) the eta >= 0.3 regime EXISTS only in the MOND-boosted external fields: MW satellites (eta ~ 0.4-1.2 at 60-150 kpc) and Virgo spirals (eta ~ 0.3-1.0 at 0.5-2 Mpc) -- DE05/DE06 re-point to those channels;
  (4) the honest statement: the framework's magnitude-yes/direction-no fingerprint cannot be scored on SPARC-environmental data at the planned amplitudes; it is scored on the LMC/SMC+dSph satellites and the Virgo spirals, where AQUAL predicts 10-15% asymmetries the framework forbids -- the D-1 channel (lensed arcs) and the DR4 wide-binary channel remain the second independent route.
  checks: 4/4 PASS
